{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfcRssR4TGe7j5PW5Tmmb", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I measured how colorful each video is by sampling one frame every 5 seconds and averaging the gap between its red, green and blue values. Low numbers mean nearly gray footage.\n\nThe barcode is almost entirely gray, so it should come from a black-and-white video. Option J, Adele's \"Someone Like You\", scored about 17, far lower than any other video (the rest scored between 32 and 57). That fits, since the music video was shot in black and white. Its brightness and pacing look consistent with the barcode too, but I only compared color, not the stripe-by-stripe pattern.\n\nAnswer: J"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 632, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6446, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 632}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "167d228b-c828-44a6-a2ee-b96663d1df18", "uuid": "d4483962-ce02-4491-be5f-01d2fb2f421d", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T00:02:30.470Z", "request_id": "req_011CfcRss3VRQgEKTdT7hYMd"}
